(SonicBlue's Optimized MPEG File System was used by ReplayTV recorders and the) Tj
T* (Rio Karma portable player. The format is organised around streaming media) Tj
T* (workloads, extent allocation and hash-table directories. It does not) Tj
T* (interpret MPEG compression or require files to be MPEG streams. Its) Tj
T* (device-specific design omits some general-purpose Unix metadata semantics; a) Tj
T* (host driver may synthesize ownership and permission values. The following) Tj
T* (description uses the independently reverse-engineered format documented by) Tj
T* (the Linux OMFS implementation and omfsprogs. The original vendor) Tj
T* (specification is not assumed to be available.) Tj
